.Language=English,English
.PluginContents=String sorting

@Contents
$ #String sorting#
        This plugin allows to sorting. The selected lines (or parts of lines) 
are sorting only. A key for sorting is the selected area always (for example, 
vertical block).

 #Only selected#     Only data inside the selected block are 
                   sorted. Otherwise, the whole lines are 
                   rearranged.

 #Inverse sorting#   The return order of sorting.

 #Case sensitivity#  To distinguish the uppercase and lowercase
                   symbols.
